Not every memory from St. Francis fits a project post. Some are people: who covered your station when the machine died, who brought the grill-cleaner idea for the dry-storage floor, who argued with you in the dish room and still signed your birthday card.

This entry is intentionally a **stub** until I can pull photos from the shared album noted in my project files @cite[key="drive-folder"].

